{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"Haven't you seen all those things out there?","uri":"8866c69dec66cdbb158db7711e4a9cbe.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"Hello again. I saw you managed to get Kennith off the platform. Well done. He wasn't safe around those slugs.","uri":"bc216e54f3cdb67b8c5bbf1ae5eee151.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"Here.","uri":"769895b9dde3c6074f8559b28dc922b1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"I doubt the fishermen will come near you if you can get this torch lit.","uri":"9e554231ba5d866c5b3bfa0187fc03ae.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"I figured as much.","uri":"8c6ccdb8e8343f64ab8d8073df27e6df.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"I guess I'll just have to keep an eye on things here until a way of removing the slugs can be found.","uri":"dad4912af4847452a4e40a1ce2d9160e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"It all began about a week ago. We pulled up a haul of deep sea flatfish. Mixed in with them we found those slug things, but thought nothing of it.","uri":"99d2537a8e250ba2366b5e622f8310d3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"Just be sure to watch your back. The fishermen seem to have taken notice of you.","uri":"f256601945dfe6302275e97d0f2d81d3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"No, these fishermen are my friends, I'm sure they can be saved. I'm going to stay and try to get rid of all these slugs.","uri":"00ac9869130fac8b3eddd576d0416365.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"Not long after that my friends began to change, now they spend all day pulling in hauls of fish, only to throw back the fish and keep those nasty sea slugs.","uri":"62b52f8f442f09574a1a7fe37f0b8a98.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"Not yet but I'll keep working on it.","uri":"39897db62463912282dab56bb0390136.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"Oh you mean Kent's son. He's around somewhere, probably hiding if he knows what's good for him.","uri":"2ef3215cf555d1a98dfc3c7dad6c15fb.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"Oh, thank the gods it's you. They've all gone mad I tell you, one of the fishermen tried to throw me into the sea!","uri":"7b274576ad4268618f5e704dd21f77eb.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"That was silly, fortunately I have another. Here, take it.","uri":"b2f5f37ec90b45724c7541c64a5f242f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"That's okay. I just can't shake the feeling that this is the start of something... Terrible.","uri":"131957311747b672399350d616706ef3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"The fishermen are becoming stranger by the minute, and they keep pulling up those blasted sea slugs.","uri":"00fc94c1d9ff14c8f926efee08fca215.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"The only problem is all the wood and flint are damp... I can't light a thing!","uri":"cc4d656dd09271748e2b171038d39e06.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"The sea slugs are scared of heat, I figured that out when I tried to cook them.","uri":"78d30581da544d513f9da2e8b6c80d1b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"This is no time for humour.","uri":"8e06ee24019a291c70772be363f5e95a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"Well done traveller, you'd better get Kennith out of here soon.","uri":"e21a07e9807751b9985111f026e0c700.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"What am I supposed to do with those? I haven't figured out how to kill one yet, if I put them near the stove they squirm and jump away.","uri":"4cff44f8b45bc70b17a92128aa1e1785.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"What are you doing here?","uri":"2ad0ae608e398d9e78fc9c74b252a584.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"What? Who are you? Come inside quickly!","uri":"ec43428c72000e2d589b76963ef63d25.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"Yes, I dread to think what would happen if they got to Witchaven nearby.","uri":"9e8494a8ca6e11f28fa7f21fb56c41f9.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Bailey","text":"You too.","uri":"3db18d9d7d98fcb95773526e5a461fd0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Brave, have you any news about my son and his father?","uri":"19a3ac8a58006a361ac75a1aa605160b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Brave, you've returned!","uri":"f1f47209130c64d5e40cff79ab5270ac.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Bye.","uri":"7d0cf4cd4afbeab13bbe68334b432e04.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Here, take these Oyster pearls as a reward. They're worth quite a bit and can be used to make lethal crossbow bolts.","uri":"82c5ce94d9d5ffedd0b3c355f58a0ccc.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"I could have lost my son and my husband if it wasn't for you.","uri":"79b2d2d5fb41f6954d25a4d7c03ad3eb.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"I'll reward you for your time. It'll give me peace of mind to know Kennith and my husband, Kent, are safe.","uri":"b7eeec4f63c246beffea9b55cf495457.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Is there any chance you could help me?","uri":"c9afdbd9bbb4809950011c0ee150308d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Is there any chance you could visit the platform and find out what's going on?","uri":"4b0742acd796a583ba69d799dce108fe.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"It's my husband, he works on a fishing platform. Once a month he takes our son, Kennith, out with him.","uri":"f41bf4925b315cd0f0e35c18122a5dea.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Kennith told me about the strange goings-on at the platform. I had no idea it was so serious.","uri":"ef3a849d8fac69577005dfeabc9d0eae.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Maybe, but no-one's heard from the other fishermen on the platform. Their families are becoming quite concerned.","uri":"a8c048368ba34f97f23c88bf9f4352c8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Please bring them back safe and sound.","uri":"6df63dcf3c2e91db71af867b72eddd71.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Thank you. Take care of yourself.","uri":"06563d0b6d406bd2e042b162215277f0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"That's a shame.","uri":"5edba57957af6cec1df1151c11a030b7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"That's very good of you. My friend Holgart will take you there.","uri":"40632a808c3b1cf57cd0deeabb5058d0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"They usually write to me regularly, but I've heard nothing all week. It's very strange.","uri":"e3b5560cd0317d1dbb6ca581d7d0da7a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Caroline","text":"Yes, Holgart told me and sent a rescue party out. Kent's back home now, resting with Kennith. I don't think he'll be doing any fishing for a while.","uri":"69a91732812f7f749f5b9e0a214212b5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"a new home...","uri":"1084598685e786bdd891afa38fdd7e14.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Away.. Away to her...","uri":"17a3c4d0c0320fc98ed29b614119110b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Below the deep, deep blue she waits...","uri":"4b3c13a5c37939519bb9e5c796c60dc6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Family... Under the blue... Must escape the blue...","uri":"9a71b2267c2fad2e69cca1dda44fb7ca.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Free of the deep blue we are...","uri":"5abd002022dcdcdb9a29e922cadaac2b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Free... Soon to be free...","uri":"279b2cf77257fcc35d7f91cf989729c3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Locked away for all eternity...","uri":"2b9c580f1ba64f5c8bff4287b270d982.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Lost to us.. She is Lost to us...","uri":"71a56136f7f8b3abc60c6eec57e90ff3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Must escape the blue.. Deep deep blue","uri":"14351d18558b1a8e1690c43be889e89b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Must find family...","uri":"20ce2182d6d62f3eb54098e355cfafe6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Must find family... They are all under the blue... Deep deep under the blue...","uri":"0b8a5a03b911c47b589343afc6c6c86b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"She is coming...","uri":"7081f1f8a5330e7bfda372e78463ce2c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Soon we will all be together...","uri":"a21b4ca2a7d8fb79d517a317ec183e53.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Soon you will be... Soon you will...","uri":"545192e957d066add42cce36f96b7234.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"They came to her with fire and faith...","uri":"b0c14f010294dde9476981325a820c26.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Too many... Too many...","uri":"114356d81ba8896cc98d422659628924.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Trapped by the light... Lost and trapped...","uri":"a20069820446fc73d4f23992adedbaaf.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"Trapped... In stone and darkness...","uri":"39fcfbdf7d370d37ea0420f2d62a2ce5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"We must find...","uri":"c54a307b54b356a41a3f2f6b2bd1ec24.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"We must leave this place...","uri":"5d2e370ce8b5f53ab9b27f66559aebbc.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Fisherman","text":"You are not part of our family...","uri":"ecc852b7c86f1437aa200238530a5a91.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Aye, that be perfect.","uri":"aa714cff82da61503590ba4b0042bfe2.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Fair enough m'hearty.","uri":"e719e55b7dd1145dc5e80db5168db72d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Have you had enough of this place yet? It's really starting to scare me.","uri":"4913cf274f53db1971b10b0f71e8e44e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Hello again land lover. There's some strange goings on, on that platform, I tell you.","uri":"6fb3aea94a3c5c642bd46f9d7b6b61a3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Hello m'hearty.","uri":"55f64d4302db37e1d3755ee88a013dd1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Hello m'hearty. Did you manage to make some swamp paste?","uri":"eca327d43ecf4d03977257f504e5f775.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"I can't fix my row boat without it.","uri":"19531726284a2fbc61b0a7bb60c5f162.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"I'm afraid it isn't sea worthy, it's full of holes. To fill the holes I'll need some swamp paste.","uri":"bd9eda83914614bf27b8bc2309296ad6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"If you make me some swamp paste I'll give you a ride in my boat.","uri":"2e3ac4abf3bca8cd937a4f1780dbf55e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"In fact, unless me nose be mistaken, you've got some in yer pack.","uri":"e58153aff3892b88966da436a9055845.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"It's simply swamp tar mixed with flour heated over a fire. Unfortunately the only supply of swamp tar is in the swamps below Lumbridge.","uri":"61ca59b136b886d2a208d4270a00741c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Of course m'hearty. If that's what you want.","uri":"ba0da636e55584e6824e4e0792538efc.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Okay m'hearty, jump on.","uri":"a5b22746210bf04e7e42bfce73cfbfd4.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Okay... you're the boss.","uri":"7e3de9d855d4cf53ab4f678a2d9887b0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Someway off mainland still. You'd better see if me old matey's okay.","uri":"09b75526b4a3485497ab03fe0f02ac3e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"That's a worry, no-one's heard from him on shore. Come on, we'd better go look for him.","uri":"c523ec9ac5185408efeb396b72915bd4.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Unfortunately the only supply of swamp tar is in the swamps below Lumbridge. It's too far for an old man like me to travel.","uri":"996710782090026f957c5cb411d8ce3f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Yes, he's safe and sound with his parents. Your turn to return to land now adventurer.","uri":"a943886d5856234e44d59ca5d10f03e3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"Yes, swamp tar mixed with flour and heated over a fire.","uri":"dc92ebbe84907f5f2484c9439b20e448.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"You're right. It all sounds pretty creepy.","uri":"d79f11bc06dd07e733be78507033aa75.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Holgart","text":"You're telling me, none of the sailors seem to remember who I am.","uri":"089c385c97dbfbb2cb0f291e3b36775c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Kent","text":"A few more minutes and that thing would have full control of your body.","uri":"b6ccb6ee4bfdbc9346f361eecfee2db6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Kent","text":"Five days ago we pulled in a huge catch. As well as fish we caught small slug like creatures, hundreds of them.","uri":"d25cee6a7a68b5ecd48f36d8972f83cb.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Kent","text":"I knew the row boat wasn't sea worthy. I couldn't risk bringing him along but you must get him off that platform.","uri":"f90c746b13e16273041f45d2c72c002e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Kent","text":"I told Kennith to hide until I returned but I was washed up here.","uri":"cedbc76234319ef610cb69137f8071f8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Kent","text":"It was the sea slugs, they attach themselves to your body and somehow take over the mind of the carrier.","uri":"eb89f9b0e7c69e41aa9687df9c5576e6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Kent","text":"Oh my, I must get back to shore.","uri":"9c4d09fa128fe78ea838a410f6de9395.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Kent","text":"Oh thank Saradomin! I thought I'd be left out here forever.","uri":"21c1405833cd551ae1aa44177897441a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Kent","text":"Please go back and get my boy, you can send help for me later.","uri":"a6bbdcb12d184c863987c228d0762671.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Kent","text":"That's when the fishermen began to act strange.","uri":"e5f5745f2b33ae2b40ae8d65c5523e91.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Kent","text":"wait!","uri":"31668195d195b7624a1ee2bb7bf74460.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Apparently Kennith's father left for help a couple of days ago.","uri":"6cdf0dd62b5f2e39f47fc7ab3380edb4.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Are you going to come back with us?","uri":"fb85e148840d8aef4b5e583e71a393f4.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Are you ok?","uri":"16455bd047e56c5a1f8a21459555caef.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Are you okay young one?","uri":"4ff4e6d2f30c9437232018f5508a2a47.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Are you okay?","uri":"b157df53eb045de091387613427c0fa5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Bye.","uri":"4532bb2fffdb5d5cba66a33b78baaa01.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Did you get the kid back to shore?","uri":"c90d0a339d853d99d45536325bfbf444.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Do you have a way of removing the slugs once they've attached themselves to someone?","uri":"275ed5343e2dc434aad16abc85914915.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Don't worry I'm working on it.","uri":"dc5652c2e17ea3a5013d5f8ec6cb3fc8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Ermm... I'll leave you to it then.","uri":"1cda29cb812ea64ff184aabab84d8dcb.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Ermm... So you don't want to tell me then?","uri":"8abd11680c481c5c797f432d463abffc.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Hello Bailey.","uri":"87803875fe1d79cb3d7c3a5379b67a4b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Hello Caroline.","uri":"5e226ec4356b02380447389a7ef38c40.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Hello Holgart.","uri":"7e638b86c0944e97e1c42dc906d0b830.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Hello Kennith, are you okay?","uri":"011a0d6312b7d2594c5fae64f9b8ff10.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Hello there.","uri":"85c5e4ab70d7075d754c47e9c30f7b00.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Hello.","uri":"dc53029f6d2c3bb5144a3d14e4bf3650.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Hey, Holgart.","uri":"67fa2bff00c735fff07d633cea229446.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Hiding from what? What's got you so frightened?","uri":"eb2727bfef536bbecf2de0a4327924ac.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Holgart, something strange is going on here.","uri":"d3cc7823bad7bc96f3a9f6090fafff29.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I doubt they would taste too good.","uri":"ea976a8df16dc6ed4f6f22a05d086113.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I need to get Kennith off this platform, but I can't get past the fishermen.","uri":"1b8a2bbc12b0a14bcb7b7a0ddc48130f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I only hope they stay confined to the fishing platform.","uri":"03032df8e7f2733c06f9efcc62fbd630.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I suppose so, how do I get there?","uri":"0e90a7d49403aa5e13c20f945704782e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I would like a ride on your boat to the fishing platform.","uri":"8b12ee667972fc38f2904aa78a44df77.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'd better find a way to light this torch, and soon.","uri":"23ee6b6754ac9ea753895a2b4d0f6e2a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'll do my best.","uri":"6a72ca74d6b7a46f155ce659a36f7edc.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'll figure that out in a moment.","uri":"7494edc03b16c8325fa886894116d24d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'll see what I can do.","uri":"23a4753340d520c119e1105081fff8e8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'm afraid not.","uri":"9aaadeafaa7c864c663ace35450f64e4.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'm keeping away from there.","uri":"d6eaa292ef37dd4648bb89dd74df874e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'm sorry, I didn't mean to upset you.","uri":"3a79a323f32ec59bbfcb1318a523ef98.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'm sorry, I'm too busy.","uri":"f14996f0d78ca73281448049c156f79e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'm trying to find out what happened to a boy named Kennith.","uri":"d30273115781efe1d5dda0d89d7c4434.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'm working on it now Caroline.","uri":"90f0260b93fbf4c40298da5726203726.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I'm working on it.","uri":"92d11a9dd6b8b816ac1833e30b473162.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I've managed to light the torch.","uri":"677110e5d2d6b21751b01c482047104c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"I've managed to lose my torch.","uri":"5083345867bcae18be9b128572a077e3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Kennith, I've made an opening in the wall. You can come out through there.","uri":"edd488f03c0acb6b8de4a54d7fd2d6f5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Looking forward to it.","uri":"5bbcaafe17717d547b139cc36f0ed9d8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Maybe the post was lost!","uri":"a3b0aba32683b20c7f359f36cc3a6699.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"No, I'm going to stay a while.","uri":"b18946c01dc9217da58d913992d04b21.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Not one.","uri":"9fdf9ac2ebe47ea8490d2cf2de1d38c1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Oh yes, I forgot about that stuff. Can you use it?","uri":"48df5625ef2fd3b082756bc8c59e77c3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Ok, I'll go and see if they're ok.","uri":"879554040af7b3a118946741357182aa.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Ok, I'll try to find some.","uri":"c6837f6bcdb0a4f06e4f23172daed822.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Okay, let's go back.","uri":"436574c02177147d18e464604f0f8a6a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Okay, you wait here and I'll go figure another way to get you out.","uri":"06d7803e77be7f7a8301b62b97c5bf53.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Pardon?","uri":"fc11f9d8c16fcd1dfc1650e37c0148f3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Really?","uri":"7b10bbae8ead50ab26423ca02bda98ec.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Riiight.","uri":"e50a2d1f9d596378c5d3f7296befd64e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Swamp paste?","uri":"974dad58d87a84b42ae6ccf6293d7843.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"Thanks!","uri":"239d077551689d152363e3082e2b1fca.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"That's good advice, you stay here and I'll go try and find your father.","uri":"4570804d7edf7009f692a032ebda6267.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sea Slug","character":"Player Female","text":"The sea slugs?","uri":"72bd73e11a9772e355e313619c4d6baa.mp3"}
